10. Verify total usable capacity.
11. Add another room.
12. Verify capacity calculation.
13. Remove room.
14. Test duplicate room.
15. Test duplicate seat.
16. Test unauthorized user.
17. Test inactive room.

==================================================
80. FINAL SECURITY REVIEW

Verify:

- authentication required
- authorization enforced backend-side
- IDOR protection
- no secrets
- no real student data
- no real production room data
- database constraints
- safe seat generation
- safe room management
- audit events
- no Crowdmark credentials
- no AI service
- no unnecessary external services

==================================================
81. FINAL QUALITY CHECK

Actually run:

Backend:

pytest
ruff check
type checking if configured

Frontend:

lint
typecheck
tests if configured

Database:

alembic upgrade head

Verify against a fresh database.

Do not claim success unless the commands actually pass.

==================================================
